OL,3,AProtesters scuffle with police as
OL,4,Amigrants brought ashore on south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 150 anti-migrant demonstrators
OL,7,Fgathered in a south coast town to stop
OL,8,Fa group of migrants, who had crossed
OL,9,Fthe English Channel in a small boat,
OL,10,Fbeing brought ashore by the RNLI.
OL,12,FSome flares were set off and there were
OL,13,Fa few scuffles with police during the
OL,14,Fstand-off at a marina in Gosport,
OL,15,FHampshire, that lasted into the early
OL,16,Fhours of Monday morning.
OL,18,FThe Home Office said 149 migrants
OL,19,Fpicked up in a mid-Channel rescue
OL,20,Foperation by the RNLI alongside a
OL,21,FFrench vessel.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
